    "sub_name": "投資型保險",
    "sub_ename": "INVESTMENT -LINKED INSURANCE",
    "describe_ch": "綜合研討投資型保險之特性、類型及內容，以及相關經營議題，並介紹投資型保險所處的金融體系、主要投資工具以及投資決策相關之理論與實務議題。",
    "describe_eh": "To understand the overall concepts, property, types, contents and business issues of investment-linked insurance. And to introduce the related financial system and Investment theories and practices.",
